      "text": "L\nwere issued ued under this Department OM. No. 14020/5/79-Estt.\ndated 20th September, 1979, to the effect that \nthat as \nas \nthe\ntyping test under the Hindi Teaching Scheme \nwas not \ndesigned\nto test the speed of the candidates \nin Hindi typewriting,\nit cannot be recognised as equivalent... lent to \na pass in typing\ntest in Hindi held by the Staff Selection \nCommission at\n25 w.p.m. for the purposes \nof regularisation of the\nappointment as IDC/grant of increments\n. The ntyping \ntest\nconducted under the above scheme \nhas undergone a major\nchange we.f. 23.3.1985'and \nthe employee is now required\nto qualify at 25 w.p.m.. A \nmention to this effect is also\nmade in the certificates issued by the \nDepartment of \nOfficial\nLanguage. It has therefore, \nbeen decided that weif.\n23.3.1985 the certificate in \ntypewriting issued under \nthe\nHindi Teaching Scheme would be treated as \nequivalent to \nthe\ncertificate issued by the Staff \nSelection Commission for\npurposes of regularisation of \nLDCs, drawal of increments\netc. Necessary amendments \nto the recruitments rules\nmay be made accordingly, wherever necessary."
